ndp-proxy-go: Add version 1.1.1

1.1.1:
A correctness release that introduces the P flag to proxied RAs 
and decouples the Prefix/Router learning lifecycle when static 
prefixes and routers are given.

1.1.0:

A feature release that adds a prefix responder mode primarily for NPTv6 use.

What's Changed
Add prefix responder with DAD-based host claims by @Monviech in #11

1.0.5:

A small feature release focusing on generalizing some of the FreeBSD specific 
code paths so the proxy can also compile and run on other platforms. 
First experimental target is linux.

What's Changed
Add experimental Linux compatibility by @Monviech in #10

